{"5209220":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Atom By Atom","steam_appid":5209220,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5286520],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build matter, one bond at a time<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atom By Atom is a minimalist factory automation game where raw elements flow through Matter Tubes and are bonded into precise molecular structures. Your factory surrounds a hungry black hole. It wants specific molecules.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/aef7aa9f023c32ce8b6fc2a7e9cba69a.poster.avif?t=1793723790\" aria-label=\"Two Hydrogen atoms enter a green Bonder through separate Tubes and leave together as H2.\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/aef7aa9f023c32ce8b6fc2a7e9cba69a.webm?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/aef7aa9f023c32ce8b6fc2a7e9cba69a.mp4?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extract, route, react<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover elemental clouds in a seeded world, place Extractors, and draw continuous Tube networks. Dividers balance materials between production lines, while automatic bridges let routes cross without mixing. Later, Wormholes connect distant parts of the factory, a unique factory game mechanic.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/fd753ab5ce1f5acd854039d429a1ef36.poster.avif?t=1793723790\" aria-label=\"A player traces a Tube from a Hydrogen line into a Bonder, then H2 begins flowing from its output.\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/fd753ab5ce1f5acd854039d429a1ef36.webm?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/fd753ab5ce1f5acd854039d429a1ef36.mp4?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/55d4cf91fc937e1b84eac2d4cc8acb62.poster.avif?t=1793723790\" aria-label=\"A dense working Tube bridge network transitions to matter crossing a linked Wormhole near the Black Hole.\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/55d4cf91fc937e1b84eac2d4cc8acb62.webm?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/55d4cf91fc937e1b84eac2d4cc8acb62.mp4?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Structure matters<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every molecule keeps its atoms, bond orders, connectivity, and open valences. A formula is only the beginning: what you feed into a machine determines what can come out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by producing H2 and H2O. Later, unlock machines that cleave, substitute, oxidize, cyclize, polymerize, condense and hydrolyze increasingly complex matter.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual markers show unused valences, machine inputs, outputs and moving molecular structures. Exact step-by-step recipes are available when a new reaction is introduced.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed the black hole<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete molecular contracts to advance, unlock new elements and machines and transform a simple extraction line into a sprawling chemical factory. The black hole accepts deliveries from every side and turns production goals into the center of your layout.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/88b92834330a66f06b3d44db94b35b0a.poster.avif?t=1793723790\" aria-label=\"Molecules travel through a working chemical factory and disappear into the glowing central Black Hole.\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/88b92834330a66f06b3d44db94b35b0a.webm?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/88b92834330a66f06b3d44db94b35b0a.mp4?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scale your solution<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trace long Tube paths, rotate and flip machines, copy and paste production blocks, and save reusable Blueprints that you can share with anybody. Seeded maps, minimap markers, factory statistics, machine efficiency readouts, portable save codes are just a few of the many functions this game offers.<br><br>A must have for any factory game, space and chemistry enthusiast!<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/6f35eb10829852e89d4c7d04d09d7ef3.poster.avif?t=1793723790\" aria-label=\"The camera pulls back from an Oxidizer production line to reveal a large active chemical factory.\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/6f35eb10829852e89d4c7d04d09d7ef3.webm?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/6f35eb10829852e89d4c7d04d09d7ef3.mp4?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build matter. Atom by atom.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build matter, one bond at a time<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atom By Atom is a minimalist factory automation game where raw elements flow through Matter Tubes and are bonded into precise molecular structures. Your factory surrounds a hungry black hole. It wants specific molecules.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/aef7aa9f023c32ce8b6fc2a7e9cba69a.poster.avif?t=1793723790\" aria-label=\"Two Hydrogen atoms enter a green Bonder through separate Tubes and leave together as H2.\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/aef7aa9f023c32ce8b6fc2a7e9cba69a.webm?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/aef7aa9f023c32ce8b6fc2a7e9cba69a.mp4?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extract, route, react<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover elemental clouds in a seeded world, place Extractors, and draw continuous Tube networks. Dividers balance materials between production lines, while automatic bridges let routes cross without mixing. Later, Wormholes connect distant parts of the factory, a unique factory game mechanic.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/fd753ab5ce1f5acd854039d429a1ef36.poster.avif?t=1793723790\" aria-label=\"A player traces a Tube from a Hydrogen line into a Bonder, then H2 begins flowing from its output.\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/fd753ab5ce1f5acd854039d429a1ef36.webm?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/fd753ab5ce1f5acd854039d429a1ef36.mp4?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/55d4cf91fc937e1b84eac2d4cc8acb62.poster.avif?t=1793723790\" aria-label=\"A dense working Tube bridge network transitions to matter crossing a linked Wormhole near the Black Hole.\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/55d4cf91fc937e1b84eac2d4cc8acb62.webm?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/55d4cf91fc937e1b84eac2d4cc8acb62.mp4?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Structure matters<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every molecule keeps its atoms, bond orders, connectivity, and open valences. A formula is only the beginning: what you feed into a machine determines what can come out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by producing H2 and H2O. Later, unlock machines that cleave, substitute, oxidize, cyclize, polymerize, condense and hydrolyze increasingly complex matter.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual markers show unused valences, machine inputs, outputs and moving molecular structures. Exact step-by-step recipes are available when a new reaction is introduced.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed the black hole<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete molecular contracts to advance, unlock new elements and machines and transform a simple extraction line into a sprawling chemical factory. The black hole accepts deliveries from every side and turns production goals into the center of your layout.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/88b92834330a66f06b3d44db94b35b0a.poster.avif?t=1793723790\" aria-label=\"Molecules travel through a working chemical factory and disappear into the glowing central Black Hole.\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/88b92834330a66f06b3d44db94b35b0a.webm?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/88b92834330a66f06b3d44db94b35b0a.mp4?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scale your solution<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trace long Tube paths, rotate and flip machines, copy and paste production blocks, and save reusable Blueprints that you can share with anybody. Seeded maps, minimap markers, factory statistics, machine efficiency readouts, portable save codes are just a few of the many functions this game offers.<br><br>A must have for any factory game, space and chemistry enthusiast!<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/6f35eb10829852e89d4c7d04d09d7ef3.poster.avif?t=1793723790\" aria-label=\"The camera pulls back from an Oxidizer production line to reveal a large active chemical factory.\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/6f35eb10829852e89d4c7d04d09d7ef3.webm?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/extras\/6f35eb10829852e89d4c7d04d09d7ef3.mp4?t=1793723790\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build matter. Atom by atom.<\/p>","short_description":"Build a factory around a black hole. Extract elements, route atoms through Matter Tubes, bond them using valence-driven chemistry, and scale precise molecular production lines atom by atom.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/cdfd959c9602ff7e0438909602e6c9f2eab260f9\/header.jpg?t=1793723790","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/1e27622362a547d94d5d63f427fdcaf35cbb964d\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793723790","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5209220\/1e27622362a547d94d5d63f427fdcaf35cbb964d\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793723790","website":"https:\/\/innercorestudios.com\/games\/atom-by-atom\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 64-bit dual-core processor with SSE4.2<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 or Direct3D 11 compatible graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1280 × 720 display; keyboard and mouse required<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Recent 4-core processor<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated OpenGL 4.6 compatible graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1280 × 720 display; keyboard and mouse required<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 11 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel 64-bit or Apple Silicon<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal-compatible graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> A currently supported macOS release<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple Silicon or 4-core Intel processor<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal-compatible graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> 64-bit Linux distribution; SteamOS 3 supported<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 64-bit dual-core processor with SSE4.2<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan 1.0 or OpenGL 3.3 compatible graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1280 x 720 display; keyboard and mouse required. Steam Linux Runtime 3 is installed automatically by Steam.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> SteamOS 3 or Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Recent 4-core processor<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan 1.2 or OpenGL 4.6 compatible graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1280 x 720 display; keyboard and mouse required.<\/li><\/ul>"},"develo